> “How does this relate?”
> “What is the structure?”
> “What is the meaning?”
> “Can I see this from another angle?”

Air gives you **perspective**.

It allows you to step back from Fire’s urgency, Water’s mood, and Earth’s heaviness.

But Air can also become the perfect hiding place.

Because thinking about life can replace living it.

