## The three Airs

### 1. Inflated Air

```text
I understand the system.
I can connect everything.
I need the perfect model.
I can explain this endlessly.
I am above the ordinary version.
I am not ready until I know more.
```

This Air rises too high.

### 2. Blocked Air

```text
I cannot say what I mean.
I freeze when speaking.
I know it internally but cannot formulate it.
I become foggy under pressure.
I cannot ask the simple question.
```

This Air cannot circulate.

### 3. Noble Air

```text
I name what is happening.
I speak one clear sentence.
I study precisely.
I ask the right question.
I think, then return to practice.
I use language to clarify reality.
```

This Air becomes magical.

